<!--
  The checked-in copy of the set. scripts/prerender-roles.mjs REWRITES
  dist/sitemap.xml on every build from the routes that build actually produced,
  and stamps a fresh lastmod, so the shipped sitemap cannot drift out of sync
  with the shipped routes. Keep the two sets identical: a URL only belongs here
  once something real resolves at it.

  Every URL below resolves to real static HTML:
    /             the prerendered dashboard shell (live FWI baked into head, JSON-LD and noscript)
    /fractional-* the six prerendered per-role demand pages
    /pricing      the SPA pricing route (self-serve API key)
    /terms        the prerendered terms of use shell
    /privacy      the prerendered privacy policy shell
    /answers/*    the answer hub, built from content/answers/ by scripts/answers-lib.mjs;
                  the block between the answers markers is generated by
                  `npm run answers:sync` and carries each answer's own dateModified
  lastmod here is the date each URL was last touched in this file; the build
  stamps its own date on every URL.
-->
